Implement user-scoped config/revision reads, typed edits, preview/apply, probe, operation status and rollback HTTP endpoints over the shared service. Enforce admin grants, CSRF for cookie auth, input/body limits, structured errors, concurrency tokens and idempotency. Replace unsafe legacy write/restart semantics with explicit compatibility responses. Acceptance: API contract and auth/error/concurrency tests cover every mutation; no user selector overrides OAuth.
